{"title":"The Space Exploration Logo Archive","link":"https://kottke.org/25/10/the-space-exploration-logo-archive","date":1760617269000,"content":"\n        <p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/space-logos-01.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/space-logos-01.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/space-logos-01.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1300\" height=\"681\" alt=\"a number of logos of US space agencies\" /></p>\n\n<p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/space-logos-02.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/space-logos-02.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/space-logos-02.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1300\" height=\"672\" alt=\"a number of logos of European space agencies\" /></p>\n\n<p>Good luck losing less than an hour to this: <a href=\"https://spaceexplorationlogoarchive.webflow.io/\">a huge archive of logos</a> for government, non-profit, private, military, and even fictional space agencies and companies. There is also a book, but it looks like <a href=\"https://www.kickstarter.com/projects/oreri/sela-space-exploration-logo-archive\">it was only available on Kickstarter</a> — hopefully it’ll be republished? (via <a href=\"https://sidebar.io/\">sidebar</a>)</p>\n\n        \n\n         <p><strong>Tags:</strong> <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/design\">design</a> · <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/logos\">logos</a> · <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/space\">space</a></p>\n\n         <p>💬 <a href=\"https://kottke.org/25/10/the-space-exploration-logo-archive\">Join the discussion on kottke.org</a> →</p>\n\n    ","author":"Jason Kottke","siteTitle":"Kottke","siteHash":"89a883271b4598f9b33ebe87be70d38557bcd266e68aee521a8f93622e0ab723","entryHash":"b886da91df5c68f05268e0678865fdad599564f9924234bb0f30c8c1712bd06a","category":"Sites"}